ak7|a|Possessing ability, qualification, or susceptibility; having capacity; of sufficient size or strength; as, a room capable of holding a large number; a castle capable of resisting a long assault. ; Possessing adequate power; qualified; able; fully competent; as, a capable instructor; a capable judge; a mind capable of nice investigations. ; Possessing legal power or capacity; as, a man capable of making a contract, or a will. ; Capacious; large; comprehensive.	j:1psq,31,4;1yhg,19,11;1hwv,16,4;edl,13,3;1hgk,6,9~1yhg,19,11;1hgk,6,9;1hwv,16,4;1psq,31,4;edl,13,3	e:1hl5,67,35;p3e,54,7;tmw,41,6;1erj,37,6;1kn7,36,4;1oc5,36,3;on4,28,3;1w24,26,3;xvw,24,3;x5,23,10~1hl5,67,35;x5,23,10;15u7,22,9;p3e,54,7;tmw,41,6;1erj,37,6;1kn7,36,4;xvw,24,3;on4,28,3;ugr,18,3
