alf|a|Resembling a hair; fine; minute; very slender; having minute tubes or interspaces; having very small bore; as, the capillary vessels of animals and plants. ; Pertaining to capillary tubes or vessels; as, capillary action.	j:sop,105,3~sop,105,3
