aop|n|The act of seizing by force, or getting possession of by superior power or by stratagem; as, the capture of an enemy, a vessel, or a criminal. ; The securing of an object of strife or desire, as by the power of some attraction. ; The thing taken by force, surprise, or stratagem; a prize; prey.	a:1st3,66,4;vn4,34,2;15m5,30,1;agz,10,1~1st3,66,4;vn4,34,2;agz,10,1;15m5,30,1	n:qqk,73,4;1st3,66,4;15m5,61,9;aqc,59,1;11j2,20,3;htb,17,2~15m5,61,9;qqk,73,4;1st3,66,4;11j2,20,3;htb,17,2;aqc,59,1	N:jba,50,5;20f9,42,7~20f9,42,7;jba,50,5
