b2f|n|of Cast ; The act of one who casts or throws, as in fishing. ; The act or process of making casts or impressions, or of shaping metal or plaster in a mold; the act or the process of pouring molten metal into a mold. ; That which is cast in a mold; esp. the mass of metal so cast; as, a casting in iron; bronze casting. ; The warping of a board. ; The act of casting off, or that which is cast off, as skin, feathers, excrement, etc.	n:130y,68,2;197b,54,2;1pv6,44,1~197b,54,2;130y,68,2;1pv6,44,1	N:1pv6,44,1;18cp,25,2~18cp,25,2;1pv6,44,1
